      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ]
    }
  ],
  "notes": "An ichidan verb. Not to be confused with the homophones {備|そな}える (to prepare, equip) or {具|そな}える (to possess, be endowed with), which use different kanji and have different meanings. The particle に marks the place or entity receiving the offering, while を marks the item being offered.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {仏壇|ぶつだん}に{供|そな}える (offer at the Buddhist altar)\n- {墓|はか}に{供|そな}える (offer at a grave)\n- {神棚|かみだな}に{供|そな}える (offer at the household shrine)\n- {花|はな}を{供|そな}える (offer flowers)\n- お{供|そな}え{物|もの} (offering, oblation)",
